---
---
<section class="relative bg-white py-10 md:py-[70px] overflow-hidden px-6 md:px-[37px]">
  <div
    class="hidden md:block absolute -right-24 bottom-0 w-[420px] h-[340px] bg-coral-pale"
    style="clip-path: polygon(60% 0%, 100% 35%, 78% 100%, 20% 100%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1080px] mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="font-display text-[28px] leading-[32px] md:text-[42px] md:leading-[46px] text-navy">Local, Accessible Teen Care</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-ink/75">
      Mosaic Minds is located in Chandler, Arizona, serving teens and families across the East Valley with day programs that fit around the school schedule.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <iframe
          title="Map showing Mosaic Minds location in Chandler, Arizona"
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=3155+S+Price+Rd,+Chandler,+AZ+85248&output=embed"
          class="w-full h-full border-0"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-black/5 bg-white">
        <img src="/Asset/Location/facility-exterior-wide.webp" alt="Mosaic Minds Teen Mental Health Facility exterior" class="w-full h-[240px] object-cover" />
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="text-card-title text-navy">Mosaic Minds Teen Mental Health Facility</h3>
          <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=3155+S+Price+Rd,+Chandler,+AZ+85248" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-coral underline text-field-label">
            3155 S Price Rd, Chandler, AZ 85248
          </a>
          <p class="mt-2 text-ink/70">A welcoming, teen-centered space designed for comfort, focus, and connection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="tel:8886482661" class="btn mt-[40px] mb-[40px] border border-black/20 hover:bg-black/5 text-ink">
      Check Availability
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
